  - date: "2026-08-24 12:20:00"
    message: "Migrated BYOK and explicit local Chat orchestration to OpenAI Agents SDK while keeping Fikr-owned skills, tools, knowledge, security, UI, and provider routing. Added bounded skill and tool calls, safe activity events, stop support, validated outbound MCP discovery and per-tool allowlisting, stable citations, rendered Markdown, and review-only social and knowledge drafts. Live OpenRouter and Electron QA proved knowledge search, citations, social creation, edit/save/reload, clean cancellation, and an allowlisted loopback MCP tool round trip; lint, typecheck, 67 tests, secret scan, and diff checks pass."
  - date: "2026-08-24 10:16:58"
    message: "Fixed Fikr Chat output classification: citations now remain grounding metadata; explicit draft_insight, draft_knowledge_note, and create_social_post tool state drive insight, knowledge-note, and creation actions. Added migration-safe normalization, typed UI actions, tests, and live OpenRouter Electron verification."
  - date: "2026-08-24 10:28:50"
    message: "Added confirmed delete actions for chats and Creations with six-second Undo, immediate workspace persistence, active-selection recovery, Electron UI verification, 73/73 tests, and clean persisted test-data readback."
