    message: "Implemented bounded PDF and image chat attachments with trusted main-process validation, metadata-only persistence, vision-model routing, and successful Electron/OpenRouter end-to-end verification. Full lint, TypeScript, 77 tests, and diff checks passed; synthetic chats were deleted and workspace readback is clean."
