  - date: "2026-08-24 18:08:45"
    message: "Completed AI runtime, MCP tool, persistence, security, export, and Electron UX production-readiness pass. Added stale-renderer protection for external MCP mutations, repaired cover export clipping, replaced native dialogs, passed 100 tests and live all-tool verification. Standard Turbopack build remains unverified because the Codex host denies its internal worker port binding."
