    message: "Completed production-readiness verification with 125/125 tests, full packaged Electron interaction coverage, isolated all-nine-tool MCP testing across two relaunches, durable mutation readback, and unchanged real workspace counts. Added a validated packaged-QA workspace override and evidence report. Functional gates pass; macOS distribution remains blocked by machine-wide trust evaluation."
