    message: "Completed 128/128 tests and added a cross-profile workspace lock that blocks dev/package races. Live packaged dual-instance verification passed. Built, Developer-ID-signed, notarized, stapled, Gatekeeper-accepted, quarantined-launched, and release-verified race-fixed app/DMG/ZIP artifacts. Current data is 8 spaces, 43 notes, 0 chats, 5 creations after the pre-fix stale renderer race; an asserted mode-0600 recovery payload restores 12 chats and 7 creations, pending explicit approval before cloud mutation."
